 4. 🎸 Ed Sheeran tour drama, explained 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Ed Sheeran performs at Madison Square Garden on Dec. 12, 2025. Photo: Kevin Mazur/Getty Images for iHeartRadio Ed Sheeran's tour has been rocked by the decision to drop Macklemore as an opener because of the rapper's onstage pro-Palestinian comments. 

 All of Sheeran's other supporting acts have since dropped out — including a group that performs with Sheeran during part of the show. Sheeran, who's scheduled to perform in Philadelphia on Saturday, said that the tour promoter made the decision to cut Macklemore.

 Macklemore has said that his removal was the result of an effort led by Robert Kraft, the billionaire owner of the New England Patriots. What to know . 

 
 
